  characterName: Tenzin Sherpa
  promptText: Loggers operating under false ranger permits are cutting sacred pines.
    Recording could provide evidence for accountability, yet surveillance and reprisals
    already threaten families. The choice balances public exposure with personal
    safety.
  leftAnswer: A clear record may force accountability and halt illegal cutting.
  rightAnswer: Keeping quiet can shield your family from immediate retaliation.
